card.statement:
The element $f+ze\in\mf g((z^{-1}))$ is semisimple, and we have the decomposition $\mf g((z^{-1}))=\mf h\oplus\mf h^\perp$, where

\begin{equation}
\mf h=\Ker\ad(f+ze)=
\mf g_0^f((z^{-1}))\oplus\mb F(f+ze)((z^{-1}))
\end{equation}

and

\begin{equation}
\mf h^\perp=\im\ad(f+ze)=
\mf g_{-\frac12}((z^{-1}))\oplus\mb Fx((z^{-1}))\oplus\mf g_{\frac12}((z^{-1}))
\oplus\mb F(f-ze)((z^{-1}))\,.
\end{equation}
